diff --git a/docs/api/sections/activities.md b/docs/api/sections/activities.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..57d1f2a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/api/sections/activities.md
@@ -0,0 +1,79 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events that make up the account timeline, such as cards being
+added, assigned, moved, or commented on. They are the same kind of events shown on
+the home timeline, with two exceptions: the deprecated `card_collection_changed`
+events are omitted, and `card_title_changed` events are included.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity events that you can access, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by user ID(s) who performed the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vaeq9m0kybd8r8f4ih4v3",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+    "description": "David assigned Jason to &quot;First!&quot;",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zppzlksuj4mxba2nbzn"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 1,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm"
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+The `eventable` is the resource the activity is about, either a card or a comment,
+and uses the same representation as the [cards](cards.md) and [comments](comments.md)
+endpoints. `board` and `creator` use their usual representations as well.
+
+The `url` of a card activity opens the card. The `url` of a comment activity opens
+the card the comment was posted on, anchored at that comment.
+
+The `description` is returned in its plain text form.
+
+The `particulars` object exposes the details of the activity:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+
+Any other action returns an empty `particulars` object. Missing board, title, or
+column values are returned as empty strings.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
